<title>JAPAN: Hazama Corp shares fall on weak earnings.</title>
<headline>Hazama Corp shares fall on weak earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in leading Japanese contractor Hazama Corp fell in early Tokyo trading on Monday following the company's announcement last week of weak earnings, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0030 GMT, the shares were down 12 yen at 213, making the company the biggest percentage loser on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange. Turnover was 382,000.</p>
